# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview of AI skills for Qiskit quantum computing workflows."
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan kemahiran AI untuk aliran kerja pengkomputeran kuantum Qiskit."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit AI skills"
msgstr "Kemahiran AI Qiskit"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit AI skills {#qiskit-ai-skills}"
msgstr "Kemahiran AI Qiskit {#qiskit-ai-skills}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Qiskit AI skills repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) has a set of skills that you can use with AI assistants, such as Bob, Claude, or ChatGPT. An AI skill is a reusable set of instructions that teaches the assistant how to complete a specific task.  Skills can help save time and ensure that repeatable tasks are done consistently and correctly.  \n"
msgstr "[Repositori kemahiran AI Qiskit](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) mempunyai satu set kemahiran yang boleh anda gunakan dengan pembantu AI, seperti Bob, Claude, atau ChatGPT. Kemahiran AI ialah satu set arahan boleh guna semula yang mengajar pembantu tersebut cara menyelesaikan tugas tertentu.  Kemahiran boleh membantu menjimatkan masa dan memastikan tugas berulang dilakukan secara konsisten dan betul.  \n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use a Qiskit AI skill, follow the instructions for your AI assistant.  In general, you just need to give the skill to the assistant, then tell it where to apply the skill.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menggunakan kemahiran AI Qiskit, ikut arahan untuk pembantu AI anda.  Secara umum, anda hanya perlu memberikan kemahiran tersebut kepada pembantu, kemudian beritahu di mana hendak menggunakan kemahiran tersebut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation {#installation}"
msgstr "Pemasangan {#installation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These skills follow the [Agent Skills](https://agentskills.io/) standard and can\n"
"be installed into compatible AI coding agents using the [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills), through\n"
"native agent plugin marketplaces, or by cloning the repository.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kemahiran ini mengikut standard [Agent Skills](https://agentskills.io/) dan boleh\n"
"dipasang pada ejen pengekodan AI yang serasi menggunakan [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills), melalui\n"
"pasar plugin ejen asli, atau dengan mengklon repositori.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick start {#quick-start}"
msgstr "Mula pantas {#quick-start}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The easiest way to install is with the [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills):\n"
msgstr "Cara paling mudah untuk memasang ialah dengan [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills):\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This will prompt you to pick which agent(s) to install for and whether to install globally or just for the current project.\n"
msgstr "Ini akan meminta anda memilih ejen yang hendak dipasang dan sama ada hendak memasang secara global atau hanya untuk projek semasa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Install a specific skill:**\n"
msgstr "**Pasang kemahiran tertentu:**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Keep installed skills current:**\n"
msgstr "**Pastikan kemahiran yang dipasang sentiasa terkini:**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install as a plugin {#install-as-a-plugin}"
msgstr "Pasang sebagai plugin {#install-as-a-plugin}"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Claude Code {#claude-code}"
msgstr "Claude Code {#claude-code}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install using the [plugin marketplace](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/discover-plugins#add-from-github):\n"
msgstr "Pasang menggunakan [pasar plugin](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/discover-plugins#add-from-github):\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Codex {#codex}"
msgstr "Codex {#codex}"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cursor {#cursor}"
msgstr "Cursor {#cursor}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from the Cursor marketplace if available, or use the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) above with `--agent cursor`. See [Cursor plugins docs](https://cursor.com/docs/plugins) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Pasang daripada pasar Cursor jika tersedia, atau gunakan [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) di atas dengan `--agent cursor`. Lihat [dokumentasi plugin Cursor](https://cursor.com/docs/plugins) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"
msgstr "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bob has no plugin/marketplace step — it reads `SKILL.md` files directly from `.bob/skills/` in a cloned project. The repository symlinks the skills to `.bob/skills/<name>`  so cloning the repo is sufficient.\n"
msgstr "Bob tidak mempunyai langkah plugin/pasar — ia membaca fail `SKILL.md` terus daripada `.bob/skills/` dalam projek yang diklon. Repositori ini memaut simbolik kemahiran ke `.bob/skills/<name>`  jadi mengklon repositori sudah memadai.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also install with the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) above with `--agent bob`.\n"
msgstr "Anda juga boleh memasang dengan [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) di atas dengan `--agent bob`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone / Copy {#clone--copy}"
msgstr "Klon / Salin {#clone--copy}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your agent does not support a native plugin or the skills CLI, clone this repo and copy the desired skill directory to the agent's supported skill directory:\n"
msgstr "Jika ejen anda tidak menyokong plugin asli atau skills CLI, klon repositori ini dan salin direktori kemahiran yang dikehendaki ke direktori kemahiran yang disokong oleh ejen:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Agent | Skill Directory | Docs |\n"
"|-------|-----------------| ----- |\n"
"| Claude Code | `~/.claude/skills/` | [docs](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills)\n"
"| Codex | `~/.codex/skills/` | [docs](https://developers.openai.com/codex/skills)\n"
"| Cursor | `~/.cursor/skills/` | [docs](https://cursor.com/docs/context/skills)\n"
"| IBM Bob | `.bob/skills/` | [docs](https://bob.ibm.com/docs/ide/features/skills)\n"
msgstr ""
"| Ejen | Direktori Kemahiran | Dokumentasi |\n"
"|-------|-----------------| ----- |\n"
"| Claude Code | `~/.claude/skills/` | [docs](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills)\n"
"| Codex | `~/.codex/skills/` | [docs](https://developers.openai.com/codex/skills)\n"
"| Cursor | `~/.cursor/skills/` | [docs](https://cursor.com/docs/context/skills)\n"
"| IBM Bob | `.bob/skills/` | [docs](https://bob.ibm.com/docs/ide/features/skills)\n"
